    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A substantial and beautifully positioned five bedroom detached home in Binroe, Killybegs, offering uninterrupted panoramic views over Killybegs Harbour and the surrounding coastline. This impressive property combines generous internal space with a standout coastal outlook, creating a unique opportunity for buyers seeking a family home in a truly scenic setting. \n\nThe accommodation includes a bright living area designed to take full advantage of the harbour views, a well appointed kitchen and dining space, and five comfortable bedrooms providing excellent flexibility for family living, guests, or home office use. The home carries a C3 energy rating, reflecting solid efficiency and modern comfort throughout. \n\nExternally, the property enjoys a private site with ample outdoor space to relax and appreciate the exceptional views, along with convenient parking and a peaceful rural coastal atmosphere. \n\nBinroe offers a quiet and highly desirable location just minutes from Killybegs town centre, schools, shops, and the harbour, while still providing the privacy and calm of countryside living. With its commanding outlook, spacious layout, and strong energy rating, this home stands out as a rare and attractive offering in the Killybegs area."
      },
